SUMMARY:Thailand Sea Side Discovery: Bangkok\, Phuket and Krabi Island
DESCRIPTION:20s 30s Toronto Social & Activities\nJoin us for an unforgetta
 ble 10-day Meetup adventure through Thailand\, blending culture\, temples\
 , islands\, beaches\, and relaxed free time. This trip is a true Meetup - 
 designed for those who want to travel the world and explore exotic destina
 tions like Thailand\, but don’t want to do it alone. We are traveling as
  a group\, while still enjoying flexibility and optional experiences.\nThi
 s journey blends the energy of Bangkok\, the tropical beauty of Phuket\, a
 nd the laid-back charm of Krabi\, creating the perfect balance of culture\
 , nature\, and downtime. We will explore iconic temples\, cruise through s
 tunning islands\, relax on white-sand beaches\, and enjoy free time to wan
 der\, shop\, or simply slow down and soak it all in.\n\n**Trip Highlights*
 *\n• Bangkok City & Temple Tour\n• Optional Ayutthaya Day Trip\n• Fl
 ight to Phuket included\n• Phi Phi Islands Tour\n• Big Buddha Visit\n
 • Scenic drive from Phuket to Krabi\n• 4 Island Hopping Tour with Picn
 ic\n\n**Who is this trip for**\n✔ Solo travelers who don’t want to tra
 vel alone\n✔ People who want structure without feeling rushed\n✔ Trave
 lers who enjoy a mix of sightseeing and free time\n✔ Anyone who wants to
  experience Thailand with a fun\, supportive group\n\nThis adventure is id
 eal for solo travelers\, friends\, couples and even families\, who want th
 e comfort of a group while keeping the experience fun and social.\n\nThe b
 est way to see what it's like is to check the gallery with past pix from o
 ur previous trip: https://photos.app.goo.gl/qXfrs5zQp5rULNvb9\n\nFor a det
 ailed Day By Day itinerary [Click Here](https://forms.gle/cQdqYw74gAYqphXX
 8) to fill out the form and receive information.\n\n**Land Tour cost $2997
  per person\, double occupancy (we match roommates for those willing to sh
 are and save).**\n**If you want your own room: Solo occupancy $3867**\n\n*
 *The only way to secure your spot for this meetup is a $325 deposit that i
 s refundable up to 90 days before departure.**\n**[Click here for secure d
 eposit link](https://www.paypal.com/instantcommerce/checkout/4K9UHVSFEL8UA
 )**\n\nWhen you make a deposit be sure to fill out this [ATTENDEE’S FORM
 ](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScjUyrsruOGiQWnWgqn-hiNuIpheVNC
 kYkavtNyYNsAnn0tZA/viewform).\nAs mentioned\, . . . the cost is $2997. Thi
 s is for the "Land" portion only. **International airfare is not included.
 ** This gives you the flexibility to have a flight with timing that works 
 best for you. Or to use points/miles.\nEkaterina can also help arrange you
 r airfare.\nTo contact her for more info\, [CLICK HERE](https://www.meetup
 .com/messages/?new_convo=true&member_id=14363992) [to send her a message.]
 (https://secure.meetup.com/messages/?new_convo=true&member_id=14363992)\n\
 n**What is included in the cost:**\n✔ Meet & greet upon arrival at the a
 irport\n✔ 3 Nights in Bangkok\n✔ 3 Nights in Phuket\n✔ 3 Nights in K
 rabi\n✔ Accommodation with daily breakfast as mention\n✔ Airfare from 
 Bangkok to Phuket\n✔Transfer services in private air-conditioned vehicle
 \n✔English speaking guide throughout program\n✔Entrance fees\, other b
 oat fees where applicable\n✔ Meals as listed in the program\n✔Bottled 
 water on coach during transfer\n✔ Airport arrival and departure transfer
 s in Bangkok\n✔ Airport arrival transfer in Phuket (one time together fo
 r the group)\n✔ Airport departure transfers in Krabi\n✔ Road transfer 
 from Phuket to Krabi\n\n**What is not included:**\n\n* International Airfa
 re\n* Meals not mentioned in the itinerary\n* Visa\n* Early check-in and l
 ate check-out\n* Tips\, drinks\, personal expenses and others\n* Travel in
 surance\n\nWant more info?\n[Click Here to fill out our info request form]
 (https://forms.gle/cQdqYw74gAYqphXX8)\nOR\nRSVP to the event with your ema
 il to receive additional info.\nOR\n[CLICK HERE to send me a message](http
 s://secure.meetup.com/messages/?new_convo=true&member_id=14363992)\nWhatev
 er is easiest for you!\n\nStill have questions?\nWe do a Q & A Zoom once a
  month.\n[CLICK HERE for our Q & A Zoom](https://www.meetup.com/moretoexpl
 ore/events/296044209/). RSVP on that event to get a reminder for the zoom.
 \n\nWe believe in good\, decent social. This event is cross posted to seve
 ral other groups and the number of RSVPs on each is not reflective. We hav
 e a set of sister groups where we post our local free\, local/regional cam
 ping\, and our overseas events too.\n[Click Here to see or join our other 
 events](https://www.meetup.com/moretoexplore/join/)\n\nSOT 2000318-10
